{"schemaVersion":1,"shard":101,"count":29,"items":[{"key":"[\"B1L06-2-12\",\"應該\",\"應該\",\"应该\",\"Vaux\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我們應該常常說請、謝謝。","pinyin":"Wǒmen yīnggāi chángcháng shuō qǐng, xièxie.","english":"We should say ‘please’, ‘thank you’ often.","sourceCardId":"B1L06-2-12","sourceFront":"應該","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"你不要常常在家上網、看電腦、玩手機，應該去運動。明天我有空，我們可以一起去騎腳踏車。","pinyin":"Nǐ búyào chángcháng zài jiā shàngwǎng, kàn diànnǎo, wán shǒujī, yīnggāi qù yùndòng. Míngtiān wǒ yǒukòng, wǒmen kěyǐ yìqǐ qù qí jiǎotàchē.","english":"Don’t surf the internet, use the computer or play on the cell phone at home often. You should go exercise. I am available tomorrow. We can go ride bikes together.","sourceCardId":"B1L06-2-01","sourceFront":"電影","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"他發燒了？那他應該去看醫生。","pinyin":"Tā fāshāo le? Nà tā yīnggāi qù kàn yīshēng.","english":"He has a fever? He should see a doctor then.","sourceCardId":"B1L10-1-01","sourceFront":"感冒","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"對，我應該多注意身體健康。","pinyin":"Duì, wǒ yīnggāi duō zhùyì shēntǐ jiànkāng.","english":"You are right. I should pay more attention to it.","sourceCardId":"B1L10-1-01","sourceFront":"感冒","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"妳可以帶一些水果去看國安，跟他說應該多喝水，也要多休息。","pinyin":"Nǐ kěyǐ dài yìxiē shuǐguǒ qù kàn Guó'ān, gēn tā shuō yīnggāi duō hē shuǐ, yě yào duō xiūxí.","english":"You can take some fruit to visit Guoan. Tell him to drink plenty of water and get much rest as well.","sourceCardId":"B1L10-1-01","sourceFront":"感冒","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"應(ought to) + 該(ought to) → 'ought to ought to': 應該 means should."},{"key":"[\"B1L07-3-02\",\"蓝\",\"藍\",\"蓝\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我家附近有三條捷運線，一條紅的、一條綠的和一條藍的。","pinyin":"Wǒ jiā fùjìn yǒu sān tiáo jiéyùn xiàn, yì tiáo hóng de, yì tiáo lǜ de hé yì tiáo lán de.","english":"There are three MRT routes near my place; the red one, the green one and the blue one.","sourceCardId":"B1L07-3-01","sourceFront":"線","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":2},{"chinese":"很好看。這條藍的也很漂亮，藍色是今年很流行的顏色。","pinyin":"Hěn hǎokàn. Zhè tiáo lán de yě hěn piàoliang, lánsè shì jīnnián hěn liúxíng de yánsè.","english":"It is. This pair of blue pants is beautiful too. Blue is a popular color of this year.","sourceCardId":"B1L08-2-01","sourceFront":"黃色","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B1L10-3-02\",\"接电话\",\"接電話\",\"接电话\",\"Vi\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我打電話去他家，可是沒人接電話。","pinyin":"Wǒ dǎ diànhuà qù tā jiā, kěshì méi rén jiē diànhuà.","english":"I called his house, but no one answered the phone.","sourceCardId":"B1L10-3-02","sourceFront":"接電話","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":1},{"chinese":"如果他不能接電話，你就留言吧！","pinyin":"Rúguǒ tā bù néng jiē diànhuà, nǐ jiù liúyán ba!","english":"If he can't answer the phone, then leave a message!","sourceCardId":"B1L11-1-08","sourceFront":"留言","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我等一下要開會，不方便接電話，有事就用手機傳訊息給我。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-2-14","sourceFront":"傳","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B1L12-3-13\",\"办公室\",\"辦公室\",\"办公室\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"今天辦公室的冷氣不冷，可能冷氣機有問題。","pinyin":"Jīntiān bàngōngshì de lěngqì bù lěng, kěnéng lěngqìjī yǒu wèntí.","english":"Today the air conditioning in the office is not cold; there might be a problem with the air conditioner.","sourceCardId":"B1L12-3-13","sourceFront":"辦公室","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":1},{"chinese":"進辦公室前，別忘了摘下帽子，這是一種禮貌。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-2-23","sourceFront":"摘","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"老闆收到一封寫滿越南文的信，辦公室沒人看得懂，非找人翻譯不可。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-2-18","sourceFront":"非","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"報名衝浪課的手續很簡單，只要到辦公室填一張基本資料表就行了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-1-28","sourceFront":"表","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"對現代人來說，電腦和網路絕對是辦公室的主要設備。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-2-09","sourceFront":"主要","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我有很急的事找張先生，請他到辦公室後回電，謝謝。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-1-22","sourceFront":"回電","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"公司辦公室裡有咖啡機，隨時想煮一壺熱咖啡都很方便。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-1-08","sourceFront":"壺","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"從我辦公室隔著玻璃往外看，可以看見開滿鮮花的花園。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-2-09","sourceFront":"隔","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"如果您對學校課程有任何問題，歡迎至辦公室談談。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-2-32","sourceFront":"至","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B1L14-1-08\",\"城市\",\"城市\",\"城市\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"台北是一個又熱鬧又方便的城市。","pinyin":"Táiběi shì yī gè yòu rènao yòu fāngbiàn de chéngshì.","english":"Taipei is a city that is both lively and convenient.","sourceCardId":"B1L14-1-23","sourceFront":"台北","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"高雄是台灣南部最大的城市，舉辦過世界運動會。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L16-1-01","sourceFront":"舉辦","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這個城市的空氣變乾淨了，主要是因為有捷運以後，開車的人比以前少了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L02-1-25","sourceFront":"主要","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這個城市的公車司機不找錢，要是你沒有公車卡，就得自己準備零錢。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L02-2-20","sourceFront":"零錢","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這個城市一連下了五天的雨，造成很多地區淹水，三分之一的路不通了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-1-13","sourceFront":"之","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這個城市的變化很大，不少老房屋已經變成新大樓了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-1-21","sourceFront":"變化","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"便利的交通，不僅縮短了南北城市的距離，也節省了人們寶貴的時間。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-1-28","sourceFront":"縮短","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"市長解決了不少這個城市的生活問題，因此民眾的生活水準也大大提高了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-2-20","sourceFront":"大大","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這座古老的城市因為公共設備太舊，購物也不方便，不少人都搬走了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-1-05","sourceFront":"古老","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這座城市不但交通十分便利，生活水準也很高，大家都想搬來這裡住。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-1-10","sourceFront":"十分","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"為了提高這座城市的文化水準，市長積極建設藝術表演中心、圖書館等公共空間","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-2-21","sourceFront":"建設","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這個城市夜晚因各種各樣的彩色燈光，而使得景色既浪漫又迷人。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-18","sourceFront":"景色","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"每到重大節日，城市裡就到處充滿了歡樂的氣氛。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-2-17","sourceFront":"充滿","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"城(city) + 市(market) → a city is where walls and markets are."},{"key":"[\"B2L01-2-09\",\"跳\",\"跳\",\"跳\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"他的舞跳得很好。","pinyin":"Tā de wǔ tiào de hěn hǎo.","english":"He dances very well.","sourceCardId":"B1L06-3-08","sourceFront":"跳舞","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":4}],"wordHook":"a 口(gate) blocks a 止(stop) sign while a 兆(omen) leaps → 跳(hop)."},{"key":"[\"B2L03-1-35\",\"奖学金\",\"獎學金\",\"奖学金\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"付了房租以後，你這個月的獎學金還剩多少？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L03-1-36","sourceFront":"剩","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"他的成績很好，有機會得到出國留學的獎學金。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L08-1-13","sourceFront":"得到","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"大學給我一封正式的信，通知我得到獎學金了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L12-2-21","sourceFront":"通知","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"如果想得到獎學金，必須達成每科成績八十五分以上的要求。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-2-05","sourceFront":"達成","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我的法國朋友最初只計畫來臺灣學中文，沒想到後來拿到了獎學金，還念了博士班。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-2-24","sourceFront":"最初","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"付完學費，我的獎學金只剩下三千塊，這個月只有吃饅頭過日子了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-2-07","sourceFront":"只有","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"想申請獎學金的話，得先影印你的證件，再把影本寄給學校。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-2-25","sourceFront":"影印","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他的獎學金申請書因少了一份資料，已被學校退回。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-1-52","sourceFront":"退回","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這次申請獎學金，達到標準的學生總共不超過十人。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-2-07","sourceFront":"總共","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L10-1-46\",\"训练\",\"訓練\",\"训练\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"健身教練訓練我慢跑，希望我越跑越健康。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L10-1-46","sourceFront":"訓練","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"健身教練訓練我慢跑，希望我越跑越健康。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L10-1-47","sourceFront":"慢跑","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"公司進了各式各樣的健身機器， 我們得好好利用這些機器，訓練自己的體力","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L02-2-12","sourceFront":"進","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我們的足球教練認為，比賽前跑步是必要的訓練，從明天起每天得跑一個小時。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-2-06","sourceFront":"必要","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"跟團體旅遊比起來，我覺得一個人的旅行自由得多，也能訓練自己解決問題的能力。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-1-02","sourceFront":"旅行","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我想出國當背包客，除了能打開視野，並能訓練自己更獨立。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-1-31","sourceFront":"並","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"球員的表現讓教練不斷搖頭，並表示得加強平常的訓練。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-1-31","sourceFront":"搖頭","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"新員工在經過專門的訓練後，都已能使用工廠各種生產機器。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-04","sourceFront":"專門","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"經過多次訓練，他總算贏得這場球賽的冠軍。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-1-10","sourceFront":"冠軍","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"訓練出著名跳高選手的教練認為，要跳得高，技巧很重要。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-1-15","sourceFront":"跳高","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那支軍隊受的是特殊訓練，只在發生重大戰爭時才派出。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-1-49","sourceFront":"支","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L14-1-32\",\"感謝\",\"感謝\",\"感谢\",\"Vst\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"莫以凡寫了一張卡片，感謝台灣朋友對他的幫助。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L14-1-32","sourceFront":"感謝","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"王太太把全家照顧得非常好，王先生很感謝她對家庭的貢獻","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-2-27","sourceFront":"貢獻","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"老闆為了感謝員工為公司付出這麼多，決定親手做菜請大家吃。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-1-03","sourceFront":"親手","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在臺灣，收到禮物的人要找機會回禮，表達自己的感謝。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-1-24","sourceFront":"回","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B3L01-1-40\",\"唉\",\"唉\",\"唉\",\"Ptc\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"A:你怎麼了？看起來很不開心的樣子。 B:唉！工廠發生問題，今天又得加班處理了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-1-40","sourceFront":"唉","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"A:聽說小金離婚了，你知道是怎麼回事嗎？ B:唉，這件事說起來都要怪小金，誰教他愛上了別的女生呢！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-1-29","sourceFront":"說起來","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"A 口(mouth) breathes a heavy, sorrowful sigh when all is 矣(completed): 唉(\"Alas!\" \"Oh dear!\")."},{"key":"[\"B3L04-1-02\",\"嗨\",\"嗨\",\"嗨\",\"Ptc\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Opening your 口(mouth) to call out across the water: 嗨(Hi!)."},{"key":"[\"B3L14-1-39\",\"织女\",\"織女\",\"织女\",\"Name\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L02-1-23\",\"上头\",\"上頭\",\"上头\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我老婆最近又忙又累，因此我特地在餐桌上頭擺了她最愛的紅玫瑰，讓她開心一下。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-1-23","sourceFront":"上頭","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"為了打開(to open up)國外市場，公司上頭決定增加網路銷售方面的經費。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-1-23","sourceFront":"上頭","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"公司上頭要求小張一個人完成任務，同事們都認為有點兒勉強。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-2-22","sourceFront":"勉強","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L02-2-2