-02","sourceFront":"似乎","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"這次數學期末考的筆試很難，我有四題寫錯了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L09-1-28","sourceFront":"題","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L10-1-08\",\"過世\",\"過世\",\"过世\",\"Vp\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"一個人不管多有錢、多有地位，過世之後什麼也帶不走。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-08","sourceFront":"過世","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"這支手錶是我過世的爺爺留給我的，對我來說具有特別的意義","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-1-07","sourceFront":"具有","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"高雄是台灣南部最大的城市，舉辦過世界運動會。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L16-1-01","sourceFront":"舉辦","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L10-1-54\",\"抓癢\",\"抓癢\",\"抓痒\",\"Vi\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"貓很享受抓癢，但要是你抓錯地方或方式不對，反而會使貓發脾氣。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-54","sourceFront":"抓癢","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L11-1-49\",\"染\",\"染\",\"染\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我的白髮隨著年齡越來越多了，我想找一天去染頭髮。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-1-49","sourceFront":"染","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"隨著空氣被汙染的情況越來越嚴重，得到癌症的機會也增加了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-2-20","sourceFront":"癌症","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"為了人民的健康，許多國家都禁止進口受到環境汙染的農產品。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-2-12","sourceFront":"禁止","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"這次傳染病的病毒很厲害，出門得戴著口罩，免得被傳染。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-2-06","sourceFront":"傳染","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"水災過後應立刻打掃環境，才能降低傳染病流行的機會。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-2-03","sourceFront":"傳染病","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"他手上有傷，醫師建議他三日以內不要碰水，以免感染。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-37","sourceFront":"傷","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"病人受傷的地方如果沒有好好處理，很容易會被感染。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-2-11","sourceFront":"感染","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"工廠排水系統得設計好，以免汙染自然環境。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-48","sourceFront":"排","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"人類活動產生許多垃圾，不但汙染了環境，更改變了全球氣候。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-45","sourceFront":"汙染","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"解決環境受汙染的問題需要長久的計畫。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-2-02","sourceFront":"長久","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L14-1-28\",\"捲\",\"捲\",\"卷\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"他把朋友送他的畫先捲起來，等有空時再找地方掛上。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-1-28","sourceFront":"捲","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"家裡的衛生紙快用完了，下班回家時順便買幾卷吧。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-2-20","sourceFront":"卷","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"我每次寫完考卷都會仔細檢查一遍，要是發現錯誤就馬上改過來","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-2-09","sourceFront":"錯誤","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"我們把考卷交給老師後，老師就把正確的答案告訴大家。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-2-26","sourceFront":"答案","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L15-1-28\",\"捨不得\",\"捨不得\",\"舍不得\",\"Vst\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"父母總是捨得給孩子最好的，卻捨不得對自己好一點兒。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-1-28","sourceFront":"捨不得","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1}],"wordHook"